      <img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1018192135679381526/1412434821904601088/221_Sem_Titulo_20250902095104.png?ex=68b847ef&is=68b6f66f&hm=7e42e81fc92712a3fb9f67f855791259b2f8e33703fdeb33e8ba65878d070eff&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=513&height=856" class="w3-round w3-image" alt="Table Setting" width="600" height="950" style="opacity:0.95;">
